# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reverse-engineering scratch — never commit these.
#
# `rea/` is a *separate* git repository (the REA MCP toolkit, morluto/rea). Left
# untracked-and-unignored it gets staged as a gitlink, which silently turns it
# into a broken submodule reference instead of the files you meant to add.
# `_apkwork/` is ~130 MB of extracted APK; committing it would bloat the repo
# permanently and is what the working tree's disk pressure is made of.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
rea/
_apkwork/
ui_dump.xml
.kotlin/
PURCHASE_FIX_REPORT.md
